                "text": "Day 16 of the #SchumerShutdown, and I had the honor of visiting Hurlburt Field to discuss key priorities from housing and childcare to traffic and mental health. We toured the flight line, saw the MC-130 and A-26 up close, and received briefings on how these operations impact Florida\u2019s 1st District. Grateful for the men and women who work to remain mission ready and our nation safe. While Senate Democrats focus on illegal immigarnts healthcare , I\u2019ll keep fighting for the people back home.",
